      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783606496372,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tinder\nTinder is a mobile dating app that helps people connect by allowing users to swipe right to like or left to pass on profiles.\nIt uses location data and user-specified filters to suggest potential matches nearby.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tinder\nTinder is a mobile dating app that helps people connect by allowing users to swipe right to like or left to pass on profiles.\nIt uses location data and user-specified filters to suggest potential matches nearby.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mYz6Qi2zu0MLRLqTbJVOa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8744.402630388411,
      "y": 44.56809288034128,
      "width": 579.57958984375,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1548404543,
      "version": 420,
      "versionNonce": 2124705695,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783618016691,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- Create profile with preferences(eg. age, radius etc.)\n- View stack of potential profiles\n- swipe left/right on recommended profiles\n- users get a match notification if they mutually swipe yes.\n\n------- Out of Scope -------\n- upload a picture\n- chatting through DM\n- super swipes or other premium features",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- Create profile with preferences(eg. age, radius etc.)\n- View stack of potential profiles\n- swipe left/right on recommended profiles\n- users get a match notification if they mutually swipe yes.\n\n------- Out of Scope -------\n- upload a picture\n- chatting through DM\n- super swipes or other premium features",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eOjQNApXG7TWiGw4O0t2t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8733.769237862527,
      "y": 368.4032288959317,
      "width": 1024.579345703125,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 921224049,
      "version": 421,
      "versionNonce": 1316343537,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783618160937,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirements\n- Strong consistency for swiping, If user swipes Yes, on a already Yes swiped user, immediate notification\n- 20M DAU ~100 swipes/user/day on avg\n- Load potential stack with low latency(< 300ms)\n- Avoid showing repeat profiles\n\n\n------- Out of Scope -------\n- protection against fake profiles\n- monitoring / alerting",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirements\n- Strong consistency for swiping, If user swipes Yes, on a already Yes swiped user, immediate notification\n- 20M DAU ~100 swipes/user/day on avg\n- Load potential stack with low latency(< 300ms)\n- Avoid showing repeat profiles\n\n\n------- Out of Scope -------\n- protection against fake profiles\n- monitoring / alerting",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8yepZ5srcKHGnYTR9jyYc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8724.102517384448,
      "y": 711.5718058676767,
      "width": 747.359375,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
